// filter/extrude:extrude, profile extrude-bvec2-relational-reduction-v1.
// Only the 3 oracle cases whose defines are {EXTRUDE_TYPE:0, DEPTH_SOURCE:0}
// (the slice's default define map) are authorized for the native port. The
// other 3 oracle cases use EXTRUDE_TYPE:1 and/or DEPTH_SOURCE:1 and are
// public-source sensitivity evidence only; they are deliberately excluded
// here so this table can never silently bind the wrong program.
